1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,791
Lucia picked the window seat so nobody
could surprise her. Jason watched

2
00:00:04,791 --> 00:00:05,590
her reflection.

3
00:00:05,590 --> 00:00:10,782
The note on their table said someone
inside knew what they'd done. Neither

4
00:00:10,782 --> 00:00:12,380
recognized a face there.

5
00:00:12,380 --> 00:00:17,964
A man beside the counter stood up. Jason
tensed. The man only asked the

